# Web Traffic Analytics

## Project Overview
This project analyzes website traffic data to understand user behavior and engagement.

The analysis identifies:
- Most viewed pages
- Session duration
- Bounce rate
- User behavior patterns
- Engagement improvement suggestions

## Features
✔ Website traffic analysis  
✔ Page view tracking  
✔ Bounce rate calculation  
✔ Session duration analysis  
✔ User engagement suggestions  

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas

## Folder Structure

web-traffic-analytics/
│── data/
│   └── website_traffic.csv
│
│── output/
│   ├── page_views_report.csv
│   └── traffic_summary.txt
│
│── src/
│   └── web_traffic_analysis.py
│
│── README.md
│── requirements.txt

## Installation

Install dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt

## Run Project

python src/web_traffic_analysis.py

## Output
Generated files:
- page_views_report.csv
- traffic_summary.txt

## Conclusion
This project helps analyze user journeys, website engagement, and visitor behavior to improve website performance.
